We''ll show how small changes in your code style can lead to noticeable improvements. By understanding how your IDE parses, indexes, and analyzes code, you''ll learn how to write code that plays nicely with your tools. It will save a lot of time – not only for you now, but also for your teammates and your future self.','{"id": "6329d17610fa4ab6b7bf6e3308f8954d", "room": "Room 13a", "title": "Why Is My IntelliJ So Slow? ...And What Does Your Code Have to Do With It", "endsAt": 1779375600000, "category": "[Regular session, Intermediate, Extensibility/Tooling]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Anna Kozlova]", "startsAt": 1779372900000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-05-21", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-21T17:00:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-21T16:15:00"}'),
