st Look at the Kotlin Ecosystem Plugin for Declarative Gradle", "endsAt": 1779440400000, "category": "[Lightning talk, Intermediate, Server-side, Multiplatform, Extensibility/Tooling]", "dayIndex": 2, "speakers": "[Marcin Mycek]", "startsAt": 1779439500000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2026-05-22", "durationMinutes": 15, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-22T11:00:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-22T10:45:00"}'),
