In this session, we''ll go from zero to fully-deployed Kotlin/Native Lambda functions, with real performance data and practical tradeoffs at every step. You''ll learn how to build a custom Lambda runtime, structure your code for serverless, and to package & deploy your application. Throughout the talk we''ll highlight how to measure & optimize for cold starts, concurrency, and efficiency. Whether you''re hitting Lambda timeout limits, paying for wasted cold start time, or just curious about pushing Kotlin to new environments, this talk gives you the tools to evaluate and implement Kotlin/Native on Lambda.','{"id": "6621ea26e0e6418ca196e0274bddeb67", "room": "Room 13a", "title": "Turbocharged Kotlin/Native on AWS Lambda", "endsAt": 1779462000000, "category": "[Regular session, Advanced, Server-side]", "dayIndex": 2, "speakers": "[Ian Botsford]", "startsAt": 1779459300000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-05-22", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-22T17:00:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-22T16:15:00"}'),
