But the good news doesn’t stop there. If you’re an assertion library author, you may be interested in how you can add first-party support for Power-Assert to your library. We want every assertion library to have the same great, out-of-the-box experience!

And we might even take a brief look at what we’ll be working on next!','{"id": "a4507753c96b456593b9838416088c7b", "room": "Room 5, Lightning talks", "title": "Powering Up Your Assertions", "endsAt": 1779462000000, "category": "[Lightning talk, Introductory and overview, Extensibility/Tooling]", "dayIndex": 2, "speakers": "[Brian Norman]", "startsAt": 1779461100000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-05-22", "durationMinutes": 15, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-22T17:00:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-05-22T16:45:00"}'),
